## Checklist obligatorio al cerrar cada entrega

```
AI INTERPRETS USER LANGUAGE:          OK / FAIL
STATIC INTENT ROUTING ADDED:          NO
SEMANTIC REGEX ADDED:                 0
HARDCODED USER PHRASES ADDED:         0
RAW MESSAGE BUSINESS PARSING POST-LLM: 0
FREE TEXT DURING MENUS:               OK / FAIL
USER CAN CORRECT:                     OK / FAIL
USER CAN SAY NONE/OTHER NATURALLY:    OK / FAIL
AGENT CAN ASK CLARIFICATION:         OK / FAIL
CURRENT TURN OVERRIDES STALE CONTEXT: OK / FAIL
CONTEXTUAL ENTITY RESOLUTION:              OK / FAIL
IRRELEVANT CANDIDATES HIDDEN WHEN SAFE:    OK / FAIL
SINGLE APPLICABLE CANDIDATE AUTO-RESOLVED: OK / FAIL
USER CORRECTION RE-RESOLVES WITHOUT RESET: OK / FAIL
V4 LEGACY SEMANTIC FALLTHROUGH:            0
TESTS:                                X passed / X failed
```

Tests: `npm run test:v4` — capacidades y estado estructurado, no frases literales como spec.
